falling_heads.npz repackages the supplied time and marker 1/2 coordinates without
altering their numerical values. The benchmark derives displacement/rotation
relative to release frame 17 and averages trial repeats before participants.
No endorsement by the original authors is implied.

The controller muscle-family correspondence also derives from the authors'
CC BY 4.0 neck parameter dataset, DARUS-1145 v1.1:
https://doi.org/10.18419/DARUS-1145
Source anatomical fiber/tendon fixtures retain the separate HYOID MIT notice.
